@host = http://localhost:5240

### 1. Immediate read after startup: expected 200 and two seeded projects.
### Copy the id for ready.example.com and registered.example.com to the variables below.
GET {{host}}/api/projects

@readyProjectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000      
@edgeProjectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 2. Read the seeded project and its imported scope: expected 200.
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{readyProjectId}}/dashboard

### 3. Edge case: cannot complete Registered project before DOM extraction. Expected 422.
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{edgeProjectId}}/complete

### 4. Create a resource: expected 201 and Location header. Copy response id below.
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "websiteUrl": "https://example.com"
}

@projectId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 5. Business command: expected 200 and wcagVersion 2.2.
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/audit-parameters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wcagVersion": "2.2"
}

### 6. Rejected command: expected 422, version remains 2.2.
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/audit-parameters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wcagVersion": "3.0"
}

### 7. Import already captured DOM and image references: expected 201; state becomes DomExtracted.
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scopes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dom": "<html lang=\"pl\"><body><h1>Lab 4</h1></body></html>",
  "screenshotReferences": ["demo/home.png", "demo/details.png"]
}

### 8. Reject empty DOM: expected 422, no extra scope saved.
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scopes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dom": " ",
  "screenshotReferences": []
}

### 9. Finish the audit lifecycle: expected 200, state AuditCompleted.
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/complete

### 10. Terminal state rejects another extraction: expected 422.
POST {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/scopes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dom": "<html></html>",
  "screenshotReferences": []
}

### 11. Stop and restart API. With SQL this GET still returns 200 with state and screenshots.
### With EF InMemory the manually created resource disappears (expected 404).
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}/dashboard

### 12. SQL restart must not duplicate the two seeded projects.
GET {{host}}/api/projects

### 13. Delete your newly created test resource: expected 204; its scopes are removed too.
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}

### 14. After deletion: expected 404.
GET {{host}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
